                "id": "705211450",
                "title": "Participation in an Innovative Partnership for Provision of Biobank Services",
                "description": "To secure receipt, process, storage, and release facilities for research tissue/blood in an existing biobank operated by the Human Biomaterials Resource Centre (HBRC) run by the University of Birmingham (UoB) and based at Queen Elizabeth Hospital Birmingham (QEHB).   \r\n\r\nREQUIREMENT \r\nThe contractor will: \r\n\r\na.\tArrange sample transfer, receipt and processing from Aug 22 to Jul 29 \r\n\r\nb\tProvide storage for no more than 24 samples for a ten-year period \r\n\r\nc\tDeliver ethics training to any authority personnel using the biobank. \r\n\r\nd. Manage efficient release of required samples",
